{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>The face of your father.</b> I have seen in his face that he is not toward me as yesterday and the day before, or איננו may revert to פני, as in \"the face of YHWH is their portion\" (Lamentations 4:16)."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {0 "Resolved the ambiguous root as ישוב (\"revert to\"), reading the subject as the word פני; the clause איננו אל פני rendered hyper-literally as 'is not toward פני' to preserve the compressed grammar."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:32.215745659Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}